            "review_title": "Review at Be Anh Restaurant",
            "review_text": "TuanDinh\nHanoi, Vietnam1195 contributions\n1\nOne of the best Seafood restaurant in Da Nang\nJul 2024 • Friends\nBe Anh Seafood Restaurant (2nd location) is located on Ho Nghinh Street, Son Tra District, Da Nang City.\n\nThe restaurant is a 2-storey house, dining places are spacious enough to serve up to 200-300 diners at the same time. Large parking available for motorbikes and cars.\n\nThe seafood here is really fresh and various, from reasonable ones like sea fishes, crabs, squid, clams, oysters, prawns, sea-urchin, mussels, octopus... to expensive ones like lobster, geoduck, red grouper, abalone...\n\nThe staff is quick, enthusiastic, and polite.\n\nThe prices are quite reasonable (compared to other famous seafood restaurants in Da Nang such as My Hanh, 4U, Lang Chai, Hai San Pho). An enomous dinner here would cost about 30 USD/person.\n\nThe only downside is about the chef's skills. Dishes are prepared and decorated in average level... Such fresh seafood, if there is a qualified chef, the dishes will definitely be much more delicious and attractive\nRead more\nWritten November 21, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
