            "review_text": "thewees\nSingapore, Singapore389 contributions\n0\nGood fresh seafood at My Khe\nJun 2022 • Family\nWe were recommended this by the hotel staff and it was a place we would never as tourists dare to try it even know about. The prices were reasonable by our own Singapore standard for fresh seafood including lobsters! It’s right by the roadside slightly further in from My Khe beach. Many locals were there dining even on a Monday night. We were lucky one of the staff spoke mandarin as most did not speak English. But it was easy to point to the many tanks of fresh and live seafood they had.\nRead more\nWritten June 13, 2022",
