            "review_text": "Ana Macedo\nStockholm, Sweden88 contributions\n0\nYummy!\nDec 2019 • Family\nI came here after being recommended by a local and I actually really enjoyed it! We ordered half a kilo of shrimps with garlic, clams, squid and drinks (we are just two, so it’s enough for us), and it was really tasty and fresh!\nThe staff was attentive and sweet, the only problem we had was just the fact that it was hard to communicate when choosing the seafood. \nAlso, the place itself it’s really relaxing, but be sure to bring mosquito spray if you’re coming at night to this place!\nRead more\nWritten December 21, 2019",
