            "review_title": "Review at Be Anh Restaurant",
            "review_text": "AnhTuan - Saigon\nSan Francisco, California18 contributions\n0\nFresh seafood under the sky\nNov 2019\nWe have 6 persons and ordered four dishes: fresh seafood clams steamed in lemon grass, giant prawns fried with garlic (plenty of garlic), baked fresh scallops with green onion/fresh chili, and squid with tamarind stirred with tamarind sauce - of course we had beers and fried rice to compliment. The cost is about $70 USD - very decent and top notch quality. I have the chance to speak to owner (Miss Be Anh) and she is very nice/attentive to customer needs. I recommend for European/American tourist to visit and tried the local seafood at this restaurant\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 29, 2019",
