            "review_text": "Justin41510\nSan Francisco, California9 contributions\n0\nGreat seafood restaurant!\nSep 2019 • Family\nThis place is great! Came here for an early dinner with two small kids. Shrimp, crabs, clams, and other dishes came out fantastic. Staff was very helpful and attentive. Its an open air setting but very clean. You walk over to the live seafood area and pick what you want and how you want it cooked. The staff spoke enough English to help me finalize my order. The restaurant is directly on the corner, not the one attached to a hotel (with the same name). Prices were very good.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 6, 2019",
