            "review_title": "Review at Be Anh Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Trinh Q\nLas Vegas, Nevada6 contributions\n1\nKHÔNG ĂN THÌ THÔI - GET OUT OF HERE\nAug 2019 • Family\nI came this place on Aug 23 2019. One boring women told me to choose any seat. Then a guy came and said :”Follow me and order!”. My wife followed him and asked some questions. Wtf the guy said “Just so! To eat or not to eat, up to you.” \n3 years ago, it was quite different. Maybe travelers are to easy with their rude attitude.\nWritten August 24, 2019",
