            "review_title": "Review at Be Anh Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Extraordinary761986\nHenley Beach, Australia7 contributions\n2\nWorst restaurant\nJun 2019 • Friends\nWe have always been fascinated by Vietnam for its food and culture and also the hardworking nature of the people.\n\nThis restaurant makes Vietnam looked bad not only the service of the staffs and also the food from the menu. (We did not try the seafood so it is not fair for us to commend)\n\nWe ordered fried rice and one soup but the rice is totally not even considered warm enough for a simple dish, they don’t even bother to make the dish hot if they do not even want to fry the rice. The soup came so much later that we did not feel like having it after eating the worst fried rice we have ever eaten in my entire life.\n\nWhile waiting for our food after ordering, at least 7 to 8 staffs were sitting at the table playing with their hand phones non stop. Only 1 hardworking staff is busy doing his duty, as we needed some help during ordering, the hardworking staff sought the help from his colleagues but their attitude were so rude. We could see tables not cleared from the time we ordered our food until we were leaving the restaurant.\n\nI sincerely pity the boss of the restaurant if he still allow this practice in the restaurant with the attitude of the staffs to continue behaving in this manner.\nRead more\nWritten June 8, 2019",
